       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TMODMCHG.
      *REMARKS.
      *C   2/8/93.    M. L. MITCHELL    REQUEST PAR P. PASCAL, #6253
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO INSURE THAT REQUISITIONS ARE NOT CUT
      *C     AGAINST A VERBAL WORK ORDER WHEN THE G-SWITCH, WHICH
      *C     IS SET BY THE DP STAFF, IS NOT SET TO 'ON'.
      *C   3/4/92.    M. L. MITCHELL    REQUEST PAR P. PIXIUS, #6253
      *C     IN 628-CUT-A-REQ, ADDED CODE TO SWITCH DATA BETWEN TWO
      *C     FIELDS, ADDTL-DATA AND SUB WHEN THE PCPR SWITCH IS SET
      *C     TO 'Y'.
      *C   10/28/93.  M. L. MITCHELL    REQUEST PAR DANVILLE , #6437
      *C     CHANGED THE REQ NUMBER LENGTH FROM 6 TO 12 CHARACTERS.
      *C     ALSO MODIFIED DISPLAY BUFFERS TO ACCEPT THE NEW LENGTH.
      *C   04/14/1995   CA ZUBEK
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK FOR NUMERIC ITEM NUMBER IN ORDER TO
      *C     PREVENT DATA DECIMAL ERRORS.  ALSO ADDED A CHECK FOR
      *C     ESTIMATED COST; IF IT'S NOT NUMERIC, MOVE ZEROES INTO THE
      *C     FIELD.  ANOTHER CHANGE ADDED IS A CHECK FOR NUMERIC QTY.
      *C
      *C   SEPTEMBER 1996  JE COFFMAN  REQ# 6619
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C
      *C   10/15/97   JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO REQUIRE THE NOTIFY USERID BASED ON VALUE
      *C     FOUND IN PDER AND TO VALIDATE USERID AGAINST SYSTEM USERS.
      *C
      *C   07/16/04   BRUCE GEISER
      *C     CHANGED PROGRAM TO CALL SEARQADD TO MODIFY REQS. THIS IS
      *C     SO SAP PLANTS USE THE SAME SCREEN FOR ALL REQUISITIONS.
      *C     PRETTY MUCH MADE THIS PROGRAM OBSOLETE!
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                      LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZMODIFY-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT MCLASS-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4901
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS MCF-STATUS.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS MF-STATUS.
           SELECT MSTORERM-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS MSF-STATUS.
           SELECT MVALIDPLTDATA-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS MPF-STATUS.
           SELECT MVALIDUM-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0401
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS MVF-STATUS.
           SELECT PERSONNEL-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS PF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-BASIC-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1001
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WBF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LAST-NUM-USED
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMM0800
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RELATIVE KEY IS ARG-NO
               FILE STATUS IS WLNU-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-PARTS-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WPFD-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-PLANNED-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WPF-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
